val40=\((\overrightarrow{u},\overrightarrow{t}))= (\(($(val13[1]))) + \(($(val13[2]))) + \(($(val13[3]))) ) \(pi+2k pi) = $val39 \(pi+2k pi)
!if $val39>=3 
